# Note: tests/, Makefile, tox.ini, scripts/, docs/ are intentionally NOT
 — they are required when building the test variant
# (--build-arg INCLUDE_TEST_DEPS=true). The Dockerfile drops them in the
# builder stage when INCLUDE_TEST_DEPS=false, so the production image
# stays slim.

